    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46088" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">substĭtūtĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		substituo, II.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In
			gen., <i>a putting in the place of another</i>, <i>substitution</i>, <i><span class="en">Arn. 3, p.
				104</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., in jurid. lang., <i>the
				appointment of a second</i> or <i>alternate
			heir</i>, <i><span class="en">Gai. Inst. 2, § 174 sq.</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Dig.
			28</span></i>, tit. 6.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
